 <section class="card" id="budget"><div class="eyebrow">08 / Public drug-plan perspective · CAD, undiscounted</div><h2>Compare the same population under two scenarios</h2><div class="formula">C<sub>s,t</sub> = Σ<sub>j</sub> N<sub>s,j,t</sub> c<sub>s,j,t</sub> &nbsp; · &nbsp; BI<sub>t</sub> = C<sub>new,t</sub> − C<sub>reference,t</sub><br>BI<sub>1:3</sub> = BI<sub>1</sub> + BI<sub>2</sub> + BI<sub>3</sub></div><p>Here, j is a treatment-start cohort; costs count scheduled events over its exposure window. Gross charges include acquisition and any enabled additions. A separate public cost weight converts these to modelled public expenditures. The cohort already contains publicly reimbursed users: the top-down population coverage factor must not be applied a second time.</p><div class="toolbar"><label>Budget view <select id="chart-budget-view" data-budget-view><option value="illustration">Policy illustration · CAD 3.2 million</option><option value="live">Live calculated scenario</option></select></label></div><p id="budget-view-note" class="notice" role="status"></p><p class="unit-banner">Public expenditure and budget impact · <strong>CAD $000</strong> · zero decimals</p><div class="grid three" id="budget-cards" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="legend"><span style="--c:var(--orange)">Reference · adalimumab</span><span style="--c:var(--spring)">New scenario · both biologics</span></div><div class="grid"><figure><div id="annual-chart"></div><p id="annual-differences" class="small"></p><figcaption>Annual public expenditures for the selected budget view; all bars begin at zero.</figcaption></figure><figure><div id="cumulative-chart"></div><figcaption>Cumulative public expenditure, beginning at zero. Annual differences sum to the three-year impact.</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Live model calculation and audit</h3><p class="small">The decomposition, annual calculation table, sensitivity analysis and CSV export use the entered model assumptions. They are separate from the